{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46374","headline":"禅庭芦竹十二韵呈郑谷郎中 · 齐己","name":"禅庭芦竹十二韵呈郑谷郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"错错在禅庭，高宜与竹名。\n健添秋雨响，乾助夜风清。\n雀静如枯折，僧闲见笋生。\n对吟殊洒落，负气甚孤贞。\n密谢编栏固，齐由灌溉平。\n松姿真可敌，柳态薄难幷。\n映带兼苔石，参差近画楹。\n雪霜消後色，虫鸟默时声。\n远忆沧洲岸，寒连暮角城。\n幽根狂乱迸，劲叶动相撑。\n避暑须临坐，逃眠必遶行。\n未逢仙手咏，俗眼见犹轻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46374.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46374","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}